# Cloudflare Pages redirects (docs/features/hosting.md): same-host rules only, 2,000 static and 100 dynamic at most.
# www.hancrafted.net -> hancrafted.net is NOT done here: Pages does not support domain-level redirects. It is a
# Cloudflare Redirect Rule / Bulk Redirect, set once in the dashboard.
#
# Home for slug-rename redirects, so an old Episode URL keeps working. One rule per line, source then target, then 301:
#   /episodes/old-slug/    /episodes/new-slug/    301
#   /de/episodes/old-slug/ /de/episodes/new-slug/ 301

# Workshops became Events (design-ADR 0016, Delivery contract): every old Workshop URL lands on its Event.
/workshops/                                     /events/                                     301
/de/workshops/                                  /de/events/                                  301
/workshops/axel-agentic-workflow-2026-10-23/    /events/2026-10-23-axel-agentic-workflow/    301
/de/workshops/axel-agentic-workflow-2026-10-23/ /de/events/2026-10-23-axel-agentic-workflow/ 301
